Worst Case Available Settling Time: 198.569 ns

Worst-Case MTBF values are calculated based on the worst-case silicon characteristics, with worst-case operating conditions.
  - Under worst-case conditions, an increase of 100ps in available settling time will increase MTBF values by a factor of 3.8
Typical MTBF values are calculated based on the nominal silicon characteristics, at nominal operating conditions.
  - Under typical conditions, an increase of 100ps in available settling time will increase MTBF values by a factor of 9.9



